#: src/main.glade:440
msgid ""
"Enable face authentication to automatically unlock your login keyring "
"or KWallet on login. This securely stores your password sealed in the "
"TPM when available, or encrypted with AES-256-GCM using a root-only ma"
"ster key. Face auth sets PAM_AUTHTOK for pam_gnome_keyring or pam_kwal"
"let5 depending on your desktop."
msgstr ""
"Aktiveer gesigstawing om outomaties jou aanmeldsleutelring of KWallet "
"by aanmelding te ontsluit. Dit stoor jou wagwoord veilig verseël in di"
"e TPM wanneer dit beskikbaar is, of geïnkripteer met AES-256-GCM met '"
"n wortel-alleen-hoofsleutel. Gesigsauthoring stel PAM_AUTHTOK vir pam_"
"gnome_keyring of pam_kwallet5, afhangende van jou rekenaar."

